Polaris Kernel 6.12
===================

Getting started
---------------

AOSP common kernel (android16-6.12-lts) with the Qualcomm sdm845 platform
repository, for the Xiaomi MIX 2S (polaris).

To initialize your local repository, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/Luoxueowo/kernel_polaris_612.git -b main
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync -j8 --no-tags
```

Build the boot image:
```
tools/bazel run //vendor/qcom/sdm845:sdm845_perf_dist
```
